WEBVTT

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:02.460
Excuse us.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:06.000
I am the General.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.250
From now on, you will be taking orders from me.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.420
Did something happen to L?

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.290
That's none of your concern.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:17.580
You both did well on this last mission.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.080
I would like you to move right on
to your next assignment.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.130
Assignment... Sir?

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.540
Her.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.170
That's...

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.290
You will assassinate Princess.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.830
What is going on here?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.040
Why kill Princess now?

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:43.460
I believe that was always
the purpose of Operation: Changeling?

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.500
But Princess is currently our ally.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.130
There is no need to kill her.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.210
She's a royal.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.960
There's no telling when she might betray us.

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.000
We have yet to see any sign of such intent.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:57.830
Can't we wait until we KNOW she's danger-

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.630
We don't like taking risks.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.170
And we did not ask for your opinion!

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.130
I understand.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.040
The mission: assassinate the princess.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:11.790
It will be accomplished.

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:48.380
Are you sure about this?

00:02:48.630 --> 00:02:49.880
About what?

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:51.130
Don't play dumb with me.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.710
They want us to kill Princess.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:55.750
We're spies.

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.920
We just follow orders.

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.250
Well, I don't want to kill her.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:09.330
We may be spies.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.080
But we're human beings first!

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:14.710
Can you ignore your feelings?

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:19.130
I am from the Black Lizard Planet.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.170
I'm not human.

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:30.960
Liar.

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.000
Report.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.080
Sir.

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:45.460
We have a roster of 42 men, all present.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:48.420
Very good. Contact the Wall unit.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.080
Tell them we've arrived in London.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.130
To a world without barriers!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.250
You go on ahead.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.250
I've been running her too long.
She needs maintenance.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.630
Alright.

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:18.420
Dorothy.

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:22.170
Thank you.

00:04:49.080 --> 00:04:49.830
Who's there?

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.420
You on the roof.

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:03.080
Ange le Carre, I'm a friend.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.790
You won't need that gun.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.580
Miss Zelda?

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.130
Is something the matter?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:12.880
Ange's here.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.920
Welcome back, Ange.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.290
Do you always come in through the window?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:27.000
I'm Zelda. Control sent me as Princess' bodyguard.

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:28.630
They didn't tell me.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:30.920
Then ask them.

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.670
I start today.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:36.080
I was just about to make some tea.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.290
Have a cup with us?

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:41.000
Is something wrong?

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.210
No, it's nothing.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:50.040
From now on, our team will be made up
of eight agents, including Princess.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:54.130
We're reorganizing the Operation: Changeling team.

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:57.170
I have been appointed its new commander.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.710
Commander?

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.080
What about Dorothy?

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:24.170
When this place is finished,
the Queen herself will come see it.

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:25.210
Wow.

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:27.580
Ain't that something.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:44.920
There are agents here that they haven't told me about.

00:06:45.040 --> 00:06:47.710
Which means they don't trust me, either.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:49.540
Ange!

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.420
How do you do, Ange?

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.670
Out for a stroll?

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:01.880
Oh, no.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.750
Actually, the housemother wanted to see me.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.290
Excuse me.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:14.460
Her guards include the Duke of Normandy's people
and a Commonwealth spy.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.460
Just one?

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:20.460
This is going to be troublesome, isn't it?

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:25.500
You are so kind, Princess.

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:26.880
Kind?

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:29.830
I finally figured it out.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.710
You love all your people,
and work to defend your nation.

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:35.330
Because that is your royal duty.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:42.630
Winter has been especially cold this year.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.290
Yes, it has.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.710
The ice on the pond has already...

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:56.670
Be careful not to touch items you don't recognize.

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.880
Do you think it's a joke?

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:07.130
I'll look into it.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.040
So it's too dangerous to risk contacting her.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:35.790
What do you think you're doing?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.960
You know agents aren't allowed to contact Control.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:40.960
And yet here you are.

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:43.960
What do you want?

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.920
What happened to L?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.210
There were changes at the top.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.500
We're led by the military now.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.040
That's all.

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:53.750
So there's been a shakeup.

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:59.500
This new operation... it's too heavy-handed.
Like they WANT to be discovered.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:01.500
How is this supposed to play out?

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:06.080
Stay loyal to the mission.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.250
If you want to survive.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.670
Chise.

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:21.460
What are you doing?

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:23.670
I've been assigned to a different school.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.420
My Lord's orders.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:30.250
Our time together was short,
but I thank you for all you've done.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.170
I see.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:35.880
Is there something troubling you?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:42.000
In my country, we believe that
a debt of hospitality must be repaid.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:46.920
No, I'm fine.

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.420
I see.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.630
Take care.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:13.500
How is Seven doing?

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:18.000
We execute the mission tomorrow.

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:24.420
The plan is to take her outside the school
to dispose of her, but...

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.630
I'll do it.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:30.920
Operation: Changeling was my idea.

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:33.540
I will kill Princess.

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.130
Alright.

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.500
Construction will be complete by this weekend.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.630
In honor of the new royal temple's dedication, we
will be holding a service to pray for our nation's victory.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:51.710
We ask for your Majesty's honorable presence.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:58.540
The lords and ambassadors in attendance
would be honored to hear a few words from...

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.040
Excuse me.

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.880
This won't take long.

00:11:11.130 --> 00:11:12.540
What?

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:18.210
I've received intel that part of the army
began gathering in London last night.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:19.750
Who is their leader?

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.170
We haven't identified one.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:26.710
But we believe that most of them were born
in overseas colonies.

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:32.080
Call back the Home Office forces stationed in Rouen.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.540
And be discreet about it.

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.330
And Her Majesty?

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:39.750
I will decide whether or not to tell her.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.960
Princess, you remember, don't you?

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:07.040
The day we first met.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:13.040
I never told you where I was trying to go.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:16.670
I had heard there was a dry well
in a corner of the gardens.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.750
And I was planning to disappear forever.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.540
Then I met you.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.830
I didn't like people, and I was afraid of everything.

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:31.290
You were the first friend I could ever confide in.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.670
The revolution came, and I lost everything.

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:37.000
But I didn't give up on living.

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:40.540
I wanted to see you again.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.500
That was the only thing...

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:45.130
...that helped me keep fighting.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:48.500
I wanted to apologize to you.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.170
But...

00:12:51.420 --> 00:12:52.670
I told you.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:57.330
I want your help to make me Queen.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:03.880
In the end, I only got you caught up
in my selfish wishes again.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.250
And I'm sorry.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:07.790
But this is one time...

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:10.250
...I can't protect you.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.130
I think this is a first!

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:22.080
Going shopping, just the two of us.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:23.460
Yeah.

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:43.920
There are so many people!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.580
Yes.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:46.920
Oh, Ange!

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.210
Look, look!

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.170
Come on, Ange! Hurry!

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:55.290
Coming!

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:04.170
They aren't hiding their watchdogs.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:06.460
So they don't think I'll do it?

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.250
Of course they don't.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:10.580
What's the matter, Ange?

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.290
You're not having fun.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:14.670
Oh, no, I am.

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:18.000
Really? I couldn't tell by looking at you.

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.040
Is this a good idea?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:25.750
Leaving the princess' assassination to A.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:27.960
This is a test of loyalty.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.420
If she tries to pull anything funny...

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.880
This will be something to see.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:55.000
You're right.

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:58.170
I didn't think my guards would follow me in here.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:00.250
So Princess.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.250
There's somewhere I have to take you,
just the two of us.

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.460
Let's ditch the security.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:07.960
Like we used to do when we were kids.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.420
Yeah!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.790
How do I look?

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:25.710
After her!

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:26.670
She's onto us!

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:30.750
She got away!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.130
Princess.

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:38.710
Where do you think you're going?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.290
What's going on?

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.130
Stop!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:29.880
This way!

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:37.960
Ange!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.540
Let's go!

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:44.500
Yeah!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:51.420
It's like old times!

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:54.170
Just like when we would tease Mrs. Crawford!

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:55.210
Yeah!

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.170
We were running then, too.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.000
Where are we?

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:15.170
The passenger airship, the Good Hope.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:17.170
It's headed for Casablanca.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.000
Casablanca?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.330
What do you mean?

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:23.000
Is that where you had to take me?

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.580
I told you, remember?

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:29.080
There's a white house there, waiting for us.

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:32.080
Where is this coming from?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.540
You've been acting strangely
ever since Zelda came along.

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.830
Just what happened?

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:41.080
We were given orders...

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:43.330
to assassinate you.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.880
Assassinate?

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.080
For Operation: Changeling? But that was...

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:49.750
There've been changes at the top.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:54.170
I tried to get around it somehow,
but I've run out of options.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.630
What about Miss Dorothy and Miss Chise?

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.960
They've both been removed from the team.

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.500
Oh no...

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:10.210
I always planned to abort this operation
as soon as I made contact with you.

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:14.000
I can't afford to put you in any more danger-

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.000
No.

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.750
I still have things to do in this country.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.500
I told you.

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.580
I'm going to get rid of the Wall.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.580
Princess...

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:28.500
There are still so many people here
who have been torn away from each other!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:33.580
As long as I am the princess, I can't run away!

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:37.750
On the day of the revolution, I swore to myself.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:41.710
I swore I would create the world you wanted to see,
with my own hands.

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:44.330
So please, Charlotte.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.250
There must still be SOMETHING I can do!

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:52.580
After the scene we caused back there,
there is no going back.

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:55.290
Please understand, Princess.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:19:00.380
If you were going to run away anyway,
I wish you'd left me out of this from the start!

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:03.460
My life is not yours to play with!

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:07.040
Princess?!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.460
Wait!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.380
Princess, open the door!

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.000
That's right. I am the princess.

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.330
If Operation: Changeling means that
one of us has to disappear,

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:25.580
then you can disappear without me.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.290
Princess.

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:33.580
You were the one who was always scared,
always crying, always making trouble.

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:37.080
I was always cleaning up your mess.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:40.710
From the day we met,

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:43.540
I've always hated that about you.

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.880
Goodbye, Ange.

00:19:46.880 --> 00:19:48.920
Never let me see you again.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.920
Princess...

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:04.380
Thank you for your undercover work.

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:08.540
The truth is, I've heard some unsavory rumors,

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:11.420
which is why I have called you back.

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:13.330
Which is to say...?

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:20.420
You are aware that the majority of the Royal Army
hail from the colonies, yes?

00:20:20.580 --> 00:20:21.460
Yes.

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:25.960
Something about a deployment of colonial soldiers
against the Commonwealth.

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:35.380
There has been some unrest among a faction of
colonial soldiers who are unhappy with the Kingdom.

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:39.210
And that is why you summoned me back here?

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:40.250
Yes.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:42.960
If the information is accurate,

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:46.040
then your friend is at the center of that unrest.

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:08.420
We have split into four teams to search the airport.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:11.670
We had a tip that they escaped into the airport lounge.

00:21:12.210 --> 00:21:13.750
Wait, you're...

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:21.500
An... ge?

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:28.210
I'm sure you have an explanation.

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:30.540
What exactly did you think you were doing?

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:33.080
Trying to gain the princess' trust.

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:38.290
She believed I was on her side to her very last breath.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:41.040
Really.

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:48.250
I have arrived.

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:51.000
I understand there was some commotion downstairs?

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:53.210
Don't worry. It's all according to plan.

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.630
Zelda, is...

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.170
Is that...?

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:58.790
Yes.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.750
This is Princess Charlotte.

00:22:03.710 --> 00:22:06.580
It is an honor to meet you, Princess.

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:12.290
Princess, this is Major Yngwie.

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:15.790
He laments the state of this country just as we do.

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:17.250
As we do?

00:22:18.880 --> 00:22:23.960
Though it pains us to do so, we are prepared
to strike down Her Majesty the Queen.

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:29.250
And we would like to make you our new sovereign.

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:35.040
We're going to war.
